body:
@zakkak can an entire static init method be substituted in GraalVM?

Asking because as @fsudrot mentions, the problematic code is:

```java
    static {
        try {
            SecureRandom secureRandom = new SecureRandom();
            RANDOM_VALUE1 = secureRandom.nextInt(0x01000000);
            RANDOM_VALUE2 = (short) secureRandom.nextInt(0x00008000);
        } catch (Exception e) {
            throw new RuntimeException(e);
        }
    }
```
